<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="content-page">
  <section class="content-hero">
    <p class="content-eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1>How we collect, use, and protect your personal information.</h1>
    <p class="content-lead">
      This policy explains what data we collect when you use Foodie Heaven and how we handle it responsibly.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="policy-list">
    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect account details like name, email, profile image, and order-related information required to provide our services.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>How We Use Data</h2>
      <p>Your data is used to process orders, support customer requests, improve service quality, and maintain account security.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Cookies and Session Data</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and session storage for login state, secure authentication, and smoother navigation on the platform.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>We only share required information with delivery or service partners to complete orders, never for unauthorized marketing.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain account and transaction data only for legitimate operational, legal, and fraud-prevention requirements.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="policy-card">
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can request profile updates, account deletion, or policy clarification by contacting us through the support channels.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
